	(descr "Littelfuse 60R Series resettable PTC polyfuse, radial leaded. Dimensions per datasheet page 4 for the 60R050X variant (I_hold = 0.5 A): body width A=7.9 mm max, body height B_above_PCB=6.1 mm (13.7 total - 7.6 lead), body thickness E=3.1 mm max, lead pitch C=5.1 mm typ (5.08 mm nominal), lead diameter 0.51 mm. Custom footprint since KiCad stock library does not include Littelfuse 60R as of 2026-09. Other 60R current variants (010X through 090X) share the same 5.08 mm pitch and same lead diameter but with slightly different body sizes; this footprint fits the small-body variants (010X-090X). Datasheet: Documentation/Components/Littelfuse-PTC-60R-Datasheet.pdf.")
